message: "If you use this vocabulary, please cite it as below. The identifier listed is a Zenodo Sandbox test DOI (prefix 10.5072); a permanent DOI will be issued with the first non-draft release."
type: dataset
title: "CGIAR Climate Adaptation and Mitigation Taxonomy"
version: "5.0.0-draft"
date-released: "2026-09-23"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mlolita26/cgiar-climate-taxonomy"
url: "https://mlolita26.github.io/cgiar-climate-taxonomy/"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5072/zenodo.607948"
    description: "Zenodo Sandbox test deposit of release v5.0.0-draft.1 (not a permanent DOI)"
abstract: "A controlled vocabulary of 739 concepts for describing climate adaptation and mitigation in agricultural research results, with definitions, synonyms, typed relations and the conditions under which a term counts as adaptation or mitigation. Developed by the CGIAR MELIAF Climate Adaptation Activator."
keywords:
  - climate adaptation
  - climate mitigation
  - taxonomy
  - controlled vocabulary
  - SKOS
  - CGIAR
